WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.462
This is BOH ERP. Business software that fits how you work.

00:00:05.562 --> 00:00:10.745
One job, from order to invoice, in one place. You always see where it stands.

00:00:11.245 --> 00:00:14.289
And what needs attention, across every department.

00:00:14.789 --> 00:00:18.431
Now, making it yours. Need a field we don't have? Add it.

00:00:22.598 --> 00:00:24.203
It shows up right on the record.

00:00:30.248 --> 00:00:32.224
Call things what your team calls them.

00:00:35.498 --> 00:00:36.743
Hide what you don't use.

00:00:38.398 --> 00:00:40.641
Arrange the dashboard the way you read it.

00:00:42.148 --> 00:00:44.972
Your tax rate, payment terms and currency.

00:00:45.472 --> 00:00:50.550
These are the workflow rules behind every status. We set them with you, to match how you work.

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.062
Even the look and the layout are yours.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:59.220
Not a manufacturer? Same platform, set up for your business.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:07.617
Today, we set it up with you by hand. The goal: you describe your business, and AI configures it.
